    "preferred_answer": "The design objective is: Self-service should resolve suitable standard needs while making escalation easy when confidence or risk is low. Define ownership, entry criteria, standard actions and exception paths. The workflow should choose low-risk repeatable intents, verify identity where needed, show impact and preserve a human route; retain completion rate, abandonment, escalation reason, user outcome and error recovery; pilot on a representative cohort; and include rollback, audit and user communication. It must be designed against deflecting users into loops or automating privileged/destructive actions without safeguards.",
